tps://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312373_1363239738226092_2106854729412937022_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qMMycRRL6qEQ7kNvwH9mlg4&_nc_oc=AdozEhrvKeWbOZXAHLxqM9-W6sIZ74EE9efMZe-0fpJgYB-RLM5bSmP0RMoT-ht2zgg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8JHw4eWUnfCorY7FStSduH4V8_2Jmv0Ze-SWX4t6s4vQ&oe=6A3AB12E"}, {"file_name": "ChallengeMode_Image_02.png", "id": "1188201992987967", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295509_1188201996321300_2111120103698102006_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cNCwWGtBSycQ7kNvwGFHt95&_nc_oc=AdrATGbvUTs-RXElGV-UeofWE4YybUhGpiPkeLaOnwV5TzsQxYhbj494iCyrN4axwoI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8ha_p0RORykr-Rx5UYXcXHhiTI4AR-oufzx7J9pNq7pw&oe=6A3AA58A"}, {"file_name": "Cosmetics_Image_02.png", "id": "1737987487068873", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295801_1737987493735539_1039395962667216685_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iL-vYANeKHQQ7kNvwHwI4WW&_nc_oc=AdrfqTKEZqxXIT-IE3bewU46bFMyCeVsh_hXMWhuf1EhBX__oEmalm3vCxYZOy-86ZM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9F3QFH5d8bhSWJa0K2e9nYmINzFnFtJO1cQNyz8SbpRw&oe=6A3A94AB"}, {"file_name": "DodgeLasers_02.png", "id": "3637904013182167", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294007_3637904023182166_4032639804070807573_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5FZn1Ayc5Q0Q7kNvwEY62zg&_nc_oc=Adq1GsmAZ2ngssF6WDnHfXYFY_khxiRJvXBW_5k9UOc9kLyZgV4Td44_plPd5s-SG5s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-se_hb8B57qvTb9T4FdHCKBS785A7zDPjS3WrQoGPFkw&oe=6A3AB9F1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Landscape_New.png", "id": "898823102474350", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299808_898823109141016_4587002048357409884_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fhe7jQKzMYYQ7kNvwFFnswt&_nc_oc=Adqck14SMcI69KSgSQhUH9NnjbR7tbhdPbYMFT3t_8NCHVByh7GVjcUfLZ5sO6_y6jw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-XzZdDAThDm7DnfF5tHWGjzuDg_mkqzzLyeI6XKi8VHw&oe=6A3AB9B8"}, "display_name": "Punch Bomb", "keywords": ["Punch", "Arcade", "Bomb", "Game", "Challenge"], "long_description": "# Punch Bomb\nis a fast-paced 360\u00b0 action arcade game where you punch bombs away before they explode.\n\nBuilt for those who love a challenge.\n\nClimb the global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Classic Mode\nSurvive as long as you can! Punch a variety of bombs away from you before they explode, dodge dangerous laser obstacles, hit targets, and rack up huge combos.\n{4009259875886708}\n\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Blitz Mode\n\nRace against the clock to get a high score within the time limit! Bombs no longer explode, and targets extend your time. \n{1063827595628759}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Challenge Mode\nComplete a fun collection of challenges that put your speed and accuracy to the test!\n{1207719874395696}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Unique Cosmetics\nUnlock unique cosmetics by **playing the game** and mastering its challenges. Each cosmetic has its own visual flair!\n\n\n\n\n{1198946195348915}", "short_description": "Punch bombs away from you before they explode while racking up combos, dodging dangerous laser obstacles, and hitting targets! Compete in global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_priv